# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/birds/fixtures/no-collage
# A snapshot whose picture never arrived says the collage is missing.
wait-for The bird collage is missing
expect The list of birds arrived without its picture.
expect Refresh
clean
shot birds-no-collage
# The heading has to match the line under it: the snapshot was read, the
# picture was not.
expect-missing could not be read
